flowchart TD

%% ── STYLES ──────────────────────────────────────────────
classDef start    fill:#1a1a2e,stroke:#1a1a2e,color:#fff,rx:12
classDef decision fill:#16213e,stroke:#0f3460,color:#fff
classDef setup    fill:#0f3460,stroke:#0f3460,color:#fff
classDef routeA   fill:#1b4332,stroke:#1b4332,color:#fff
classDef routeB   fill:#2d6a4f,stroke:#2d6a4f,color:#fff
classDef routeC   fill:#40916c,stroke:#40916c,color:#fff
classDef routeD   fill:#52b788,stroke:#52b788,color:#1a1a2e
classDef calc     fill:#7b2d8b,stroke:#7b2d8b,color:#fff
classDef settle   fill:#c77dff,stroke:#9d4edd,color:#1a1a2e
classDef admin    fill:#e0aaff,stroke:#9d4edd,color:#1a1a2e
classDef swf      fill:#f72585,stroke:#f72585,color:#fff
classDef closure  fill:#4cc9f0,stroke:#4361ee,color:#1a1a2e
classDef endnode  fill:#4361ee,stroke:#4361ee,color:#fff,rx:12
classDef none     fill:#555,stroke:#555,color:#fff,rx:12

%% ── START ───────────────────────────────────────────────

START([Assessment window opens]):::start --> WIN

%% ── STEP 1: WINDOW ──────────────────────────────────────

WIN[Elect assessment window 1–7 years · applies to whole portfolio]:::setup --> WIN_Q

WIN_Q{Window length?}:::decision
WIN_Q -->|1 year| WIN_A[No premium]:::setup
WIN_Q -->|2–7 years| WIN_B[Deferral charge + flexibility levy]:::setup
WIN_A & WIN_B --> ROUTE_ASSIGN

%% ── STEP 2: ROUTE ASSIGNMENT ────────────────────────────

ROUTE_ASSIGN[Assign each asset to Route A / B / C / D Assets may switch routes between windows]:::setup --> PRIV

%% ── STEP 3: PRIVACY ─────────────────────────────────────

PRIV[Privacy election per asset Fungible assets: partial disclosure allowed]:::setup --> PRIV_Q

PRIV_Q{Disclosed or private?}:::decision
PRIV_Q -->|Disclosed| PRIV_DISC[Rate discount Enters public register]:::setup
PRIV_Q -->|Private| PRIV_PRIV[Rate premium Revenue-neutral in expectation]:::setup
PRIV_DISC & PRIV_PRIV --> VAL_ROUTE

%% ── STEP 4: VALUATION ───────────────────────────────────

VAL_ROUTE{Which route?}:::decision

%% Route A
VAL_ROUTE -->|Route A Professional · fungible| A_Q{Auto-priced or professionally valued?}:::decision
A_Q -->|Auto-priced cash · listed equity · ETFs| A_AUTO[Market price on assessment date]:::routeA
A_Q -->|Professionally valued private equity · fund units| A_PROF[Competitive-tender valuation Risk sits with valuator]:::routeA
A_PROF --> A_DISP{Accepts valuation?}:::decision
A_DISP -->|Yes| TOTAL
A_DISP -->|No| A_REVIEW[Independent review At Valuation Authority cost]:::routeA
A_REVIEW --> A_RQ{Outcome?}:::decision
A_RQ -->|Supports valuator| A_ORIG[Original stands TP bears both costs]:::routeA
A_RQ -->|Supports TP| A_TP[TP position accepted Valuator contract terminated]:::routeA
A_RQ -->|Neither| A_REDIR[Reclassified to Route C until next window]:::routeA
A_AUTO & A_ORIG & A_TP & A_REDIR --> TOTAL

%% Route B
VAL_ROUTE -->|Route B Professional · non-fungible| B_PROF[Professional valuation Deferred settlement as lien]:::routeB
B_PROF --> B_DISP{Accepts valuation?}:::decision
B_DISP -->|Yes| TOTAL
B_DISP -->|No| B_REVIEW[Independent review Same process as Route A]:::routeB
B_REVIEW --> B_RQ{Outcome?}:::decision
B_RQ -->|Supports valuator| B_ORIG[Original stands]:::routeB
B_RQ -->|Supports TP| B_TP[TP position accepted]:::routeB
B_RQ -->|Neither| B_REDIR[Reclassified to Route D until next window]:::routeB
B_ORIG & B_TP & B_REDIR --> TOTAL

%% Route C
VAL_ROUTE -->|Route C Self-declared · fungible| C_SELF[Taxpayer self-declares value Settlement must be in-kind equity transfer]:::routeC
C_SELF --> TOTAL

%% Route D
VAL_ROUTE -->|Route D Self-declared · non-fungible| D_SELF[Self-declared entry basis No periodic liability · annual reporting continues]:::routeD
D_SELF --> D_VOL{Voluntary settlement?}:::decision
D_VOL -->|No — defer| D_DEFER[Deferred to realisation or inheritance auction]:::routeD
D_VOL -->|Soft reset| D_SOFT[Self-declare current value Pay on gain · basis resets]:::routeD
D_VOL -->|Hard reset| D_HARD[Public auction establishes price Taxpayer retains · basis resets]:::routeD
D_DEFER & D_SOFT & D_HARD --> TOTAL

%% ── STEP 5: NET WORTH ───────────────────────────────────

TOTAL[Total all assets Calculate net worth]:::calc --> THRESH

THRESH{Above exemption threshold?}:::decision
THRESH -->|No| BELOW[No WDT due Annual report still filed]:::none
THRESH -->|Yes| RATE

%% ── STEP 6: RATE & DELTA ────────────────────────────────

RATE["Marginal rate τ: progressive logistic of net worth τ₀ = 20% · τ_m = 70% · k = 0.001"]:::calc --> DELTA

DELTA[Wealth delta = current net worth − prior assessment net worth]:::calc --> SIGN

SIGN{Delta?}:::decision

%% ── STEP 7A: TAX ────────────────────────────────────────

SIGN -->|Positive — gain| TAX[WDT = τ × delta Progressive marginal rates apply]:::calc

%% ── STEP 7B: REFUND ─────────────────────────────────────

SIGN -->|Negative — loss| REFUND[Symmetric refund = τ × delta SWF Refund Reserve pre-funds obligation]:::swf
REFUND --> ENVELOPE{Lifetime envelope check}:::decision
ENVELOPE -->|Within limit| REFUND_OK[Refund confirmed]:::swf
ENVELOPE -->|Exceeds limit| REFUND_CAP[Refund capped at envelope balance]:::swf
REFUND_OK & REFUND_CAP --> SETTLE
TAX --> SETTLE

%% ── STEP 8: SETTLEMENT ──────────────────────────────────

SETTLE{Settlement route}:::decision
SETTLE -->|Route A| SA[Cash settlement Liquidity facility available]:::settle
SETTLE -->|Route B| SB[Cash settlement Lien on asset]:::settle
SETTLE -->|Route C| SC[Automatic in-kind equity transfer No cash option]:::settle
SETTLE -->|Route D| SD[No settlement this cycle Deferred to realisation]:::settle

%% ── CORPORATE LEVY CREDITS ──────────────────────────────

SA --> CREDIT_Q{Listed equity on Route A?}:::decision
CREDIT_Q -->|No| DEADLINES
CREDIT_Q -->|Yes| CREDIT[Claim corporate levy credits Within 1 year to register attribution]:::settle
CREDIT --> CREDIT_USE{Credit disposition}:::decision
CREDIT_USE -->|Apply now| CREDIT_APPLY[Reduces cash tax this cycle]:::settle
CREDIT_USE -->|Carry forward| CREDIT_CARRY[Held for future cycles Dissolve on death]:::settle
CREDIT_USE -->|Return to company| CREDIT_RETURN[Reduces company's corporate levy]:::settle
CREDIT_APPLY & CREDIT_CARRY & CREDIT_RETURN --> DEADLINES
SB & SC & SD --> DEADLINES

%% ── STEP 9: ADMINISTRATOR ───────────────────────────────

DEADLINES[Administrator issues consistency credential 6 months: submit · 1 year: settle cash]:::admin --> REGISTER

%% ── STEP 10: REGISTER & SWF ─────────────────────────────

REGISTER[Public Valuation Register updated Longitudinal taxpayer history record maintained]:::admin --> SWF

SWF[Net revenue → SWF SRR: refund floor 3× · LRR: labour relief reserve]:::swf

%% ── STEP 11: ROUTE D AUCTION ────────────────────────────

SWF --> AUCTION_Q{Egregious Route D understatement confirmed by Valuation Body consensus?}:::decision
AUCTION_Q -->|No| ANNUAL
AUCTION_Q -->|Yes| AUCTION[Asset auctioned at taxpayer's declared price Winning price becomes new basis · delta taxed]:::routeD

AUCTION --> ANNUAL

%% ── STEP 12: ANNUAL LOOP ────────────────────────────────

ANNUAL[Annual report filed All assets · ownership · material changes]:::admin --> LOOP

LOOP{End of elected window?}:::decision
LOOP -->|No| ANNUAL
LOOP -->|Yes| WIN

%% ── CLOSURE EVENTS ──────────────────────────────────────

ANNUAL --> CLOSURE_Q{Position closure event?}:::decision
CLOSURE_Q -->|Death| DEATH[Final delta · refund fires if negative Route D: inheritance auction triggered]:::closure
CLOSURE_Q -->|Exit| EXIT[Final delta · bridging facility bonds Departure decoupled from settlement]:::closure
CLOSURE_Q -->|Fall-through| FALLTHROUGH[Final delta · refund if applicable Envelope history preserved]:::closure
CLOSURE_Q -->|Bankruptcy| BANKRUPT[Final delta · refund fires if negative Envelope history preserved]:::closure
DEATH & EXIT & FALLTHROUGH & BANKRUPT --> END_CLOSE

END_CLOSE([Position closed Lifetime envelope persists across closures and re-entries]):::endnode